{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3934250","name":"静谧田园","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>由“夜回”系列制作团队打造的最新作品，田园生活中的慢活体验</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/extras/7ce086eb01c31765b7985af92fb5b980.avif?t=1785440016\" width=566 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>静谧的生活，有时</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/extras/091efc4c3f64ae5b92f5c3c79cce021b.webp?t=1785440016\" width=132 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《静谧田园》是由“夜回”系列制作团队所打造，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以洋溢怀旧气氛的乡间村落为舞台的生活模拟游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在投身耕作与畜牧时，还能一边享受钓鱼或狩猎的乐趣，或与村民深入交流——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验那令人怀念的，静谧悠闲的田园生活。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>故事简介</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >年幼的主角迷路在山中徘徊时，被某个村庄的人们所救助。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >面对无处可去的主人公，村民提出了一个建议。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“你愿不愿意为村子工作呢？如果愿意的话，我们就让你住在这里”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >种菜、照顾家畜工作，一边制作家具、外出钓鱼……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >悠闲平静的田园生活就此开始。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在静谧山间延续的日本原始风景</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/extras/00d157bac3d29a9869094b3ff9891794.avif?t=1785440016\" width=566 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在日本某处，静静伫立于山间的小村庄——“彼津村”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这片充满怀旧风情的村庄里，你的新生活即将开始。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>充满成就感的慢活体验</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/extras/037a248ebe6308ed694552ad12ba0a90.avif?t=1785440016\" width=566 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主角获得的是村边一间破旧的小屋，以及杂草丛生的荒废庭院。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >首先从开垦这片庭院、建造农田开始吧。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/d7c9d58e22ebd7ed3f9e70d1e25f730f3959a324/header_schinese.jpg?t=1785440016","website":"https://www.nisamerica.com/village-in-the-shade/","developers":["Nippon Ichi Software, Inc."],"publishers":["NIS America, Inc."],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 29 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"49.99","final":"49.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"日语, 韩语, 繁体中文","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","自定义音量控制","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","立体声","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","模拟"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 9 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-12500<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 9 GB 可用空间</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/ab78ae10ceaeaae9adca7b8d1a50d048712a6baa/ss_ab78ae10ceaeaae9adca7b8d1a50d048712a6baa.600x338.jpg?t=1785440016","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st